# Random modules whose predicates and lambda expressions are declared with
# random determinisms, and whose goals call predicates of each
# determinism, some without outputs (generate-switch-programs.py
# --determinism). merkc must infer the determinisms of the procedures and
# their goals that mmc does, and report its determinism errors at the same
# lines.
#
# REQUIRES: mmc
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir %t
# RUN: %python %S/../../../utils/type-oracle/generate-switch-programs.py --determinism --seed 8 --count 40 %t
# RUN: %compare-switches --determinism %t/*.m
